        "nve": {
            "title": "NaturalVision Enhanced, July 2026 build (\"Next-Gen Graphics Update #2 Updated\")",
            "version": "2026-07 #2 Updated (NVE add-on 1.0.12.0)",
            "what": "A graphics overhaul for GTA V Enhanced by Razed: its own lighting, weather, clouds, tonemapping and colours, roads, vegetation, interiors and vehicles (the onigiri loader and its DLC packs), and shader replacements loaded through ReShade's add-on API (NVE.asi). The capture default for Enhanced (--no-graphics-mod leaves it out). Only its own files: its ASI loader (xinput1_4.dll), ReShade.asi, ReShade.ini and photo-mode effects are left out, since ours are installed.",
            "required": false,
            "source": "supplied",
            "page": "https://razedmods.com/gtavenhanced",
            "note": "Free from the page above (its download links, under older versions). The newer \"#3 V2\" build hangs Enhanced 1.0.1158.13 while loading; this build runs. Its settings live in %APPDATA%\\NVE\\settings-gen9.json. 6.5 GB, so it is installed straight from the archive (capture/install/components/pack.py) and never bundled.",
